      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "About this pattern"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "A classic heart shape made from two sphere lobes joined side by side at the top, with a cone point base that tapers to the bottom tip. The two lobes are worked separately then joined mid-round. The V dip between the lobes is shaped by pinching the join and tacking with a few stitches."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "attrs": {
        "level": 2
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Lobes (make 2)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Rounds: 13 per lobe. Begin each with a "
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "marks": [
            {
              "type": "glossaryTooltip",
              "attrs": {
                "termSlug": "magic-ring"
              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "magic ring"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " and "
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "marks": [
            {
              "type": "glossaryTooltip",
              "attrs": {
                "termSlug": "amigurumi-increase"
              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "increase"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " to the equator. Stop before the "
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "marks": [
            {
              "type": "glossaryTooltip",
              "attrs": {
                "termSlug": "amigurumi-decrease"
              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "decrease"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " rounds. Leave the base open on each lobe. Stuff each lobe firmly before joining."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Round 1: 6 sc in magic ring"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Round 2: [inc] × 6 (12 st)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Round 3: [2 sc, inc] × 6 (18 st)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Round 4: [3 sc, inc] × 6 (24 st)"
