          "type": "text",
          "text": "Joining and assembly"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Hold the two stuffed lobes side by side with their open bases touching. Work a joining round through both base edges to connect them. Sew the cone point to the combined base, adding stuffing to the point before closing. Pinch the top centre of the joined lobes downward and tack with a few invisible stitches to form the V dip."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "marks": [
